1
00:03:55,000 --> 00:04:01,000
Earth just got a little stranger.

2
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:56,000
Home is a fantasy, comedy, animation film directed by Tim Johnson.

3
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:51,000
When Earth is taken over by the overly-confident Boov, an alien race in search of a new place to call
home, all humans are promptly relocated, while all Boov get busy reorganizing the planet.

4
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:46,000
But when one resourceful girl, Tip, manages to avoid capture, she finds
herself the accidental accomplice of a banished Boov named Oh.

5
00:19:35,000 --> 00:19:41,000
The two fugitives realize there’s a lot more at stake than intergalactic
relations as they embark on the road trip of a lifetime.

6
00:23:30,000 --> 00:23:36,000
Oh (voice), played by Jim Parsons.

7
00:27:25,000 --> 00:27:31,000
Gratuity 'Tip' Tucci (voice), played by Rihanna.

8
00:31:20,000 --> 00:31:26,000
Capitain Smek (voice), played by Steve Martin.

9
00:35:15,000 --> 00:35:21,000
Lucy Tucci (voice), played by Jennifer Lopez.

10
00:39:10,000 --> 00:39:16,000
Kyle (voice), played by Matt Jones.

11
00:43:05,000 --> 00:43:11,000
Gorg Commander / Father / Boov (voice), played by Brian Stepanek.

12
00:47:00,000 --> 00:47:06,000
Home is a 2015 American animated science fiction comedy film produced by DreamWorks Animation
SKG, loosely based on the 2007 children's book The True Meaning of Smekday.

13
00:50:55,000 --> 00:51:01,000
The film was directed by Tim Johnson, written by Tom J.

14
00:54:50,000 --> 00:54:56,000
Astle and Matt Ember, and stars the voices of Jim Parsons,
Rihanna, Steve Martin, Jennifer Lopez, and Matt Jones.

15
00:58:45,000 --> 00:58:51,000
The story follows the shared adventures of a friendly alien who is shunned by the rest of his kind, and a
teenage girl searching for her mother after they are separated during an invasion of Earth.

16
01:02:40,000 --> 01:02:46,000
The film premiered at the Boulder International Film Festival on March 7, 2015,
and was released in theaters on March 27 by 20th Century Fox.

17
01:06:35,000 --> 01:06:41,000
Home was promoted with the release of a prequel short film,
Almost Home, which was shown in theaters in 2014.

18
01:10:30,000 --> 01:10:36,000
Rihanna created a concept album of the same name.

19
01:14:25,000 --> 01:14:31,000
The soundtrack also includes guest vocals from Jennifer Lopez, among others, and was
supported by two singles, "Towards the Sun" and "Feel the Light".

20
01:18:20,000 --> 01:18:26,000
Home received mixed reviews from critics and grossed $386
million worldwide against a $135 million budget.

21
01:22:15,000 --> 01:22:21,000
A spin-off television series, Home: Adventures
with Tip & Oh, was released in 2016.

22
01:26:10,000 --> 01:26:16,000
The film explores themes of spacecraft, villain, alien, space, alien invasion.

23
01:30:05,000 --> 01:30:11,000
The tone is lighthearted and thought_provoking.
